ide village of Rockport, MA. With Bearskin Neck and its many shops, studios, and restaurants jutting out from the town's center into its charming harbor, Rockport is a place of inspiration. In Rockport, we will also visit the Halibut Point State Park, a place that offers epic ocean views that will surely inspire you.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Beverly, Manchester-by-the-Sea, Gloucester, and Rockport.", "booking_notes": "#We look forward to you joining us! \nYour guide is Naim Benmayor and their phone number is 617-306-4877. Please reach out with any questions. Naim will be in touch soon to set up the meeting place and any custom changes to the tour.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonprivateguide/items/556936/images/1233400/", "pk": 1233400, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rfD45vTqRCfUSEnIWAXQ", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rfD45vTqRCfUSEnIWAXQ", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonprivateguide/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonprivateguide/items/556936/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rfD45vTqRCfUSEnIWAXQ", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/rfD45vTqRCfUSEnIWAXQ", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonprivateguide/items/556936/images/1233399/", "pk": 1233399, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/7tiq6fgNT6SFplqcLALy", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/7tiq6fgNT6SFplqcLALy", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonprivateguide/"}, "item": {"cls": "Ite